stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Initialization
  state "发送公开初始化" as Initialization
  state "构建快照 等待一条响应" as Decision
  state "曝光 分段积分" as Exposure
  state "展开等待" as Waiting
  state "原模拟时刻举报" as Reporting
  state "终局结算" as Settlement
  state "尽力发送 finish 与清理" as Closing
  Initialization --> Decision : 设置真实截止
  Decision --> Exposure : 合法 observe
  Decision --> Waiting : 合法 wait
  Decision --> Reporting : 合法 report
  Exposure --> Exposure : 普通 slot 或事件边界
  Exposure --> Decision : 动作结束或夜末截断
  Waiting --> Decision : 达到目标时刻
  Reporting --> Decision : 相同 now 新序号
  Decision --> Settlement : finish 非法动作或真实超时
  Exposure --> Settlement : 模拟周期结束
  Waiting --> Settlement : 模拟周期结束
  Settlement --> Closing
  Closing --> [*]
